{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"天氣報告｜天晴兼非常乾燥　明日風勢頗大\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/OBS-FORECAST-261128-07.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】乾燥的東北季候風正為華南帶來晴朗的天氣。本港今日(11月28日)天氣預測，天晴。日間非常乾燥，市區最高氣溫約26度，新界再高一兩度。吹和緩北至東北風，離岸風勢間中清勁，高地達強風程度。</p><p>展望未來兩三日大致天晴。明日風勢頗大。下周中後期日間相當溫暖。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T23:44:24.899871+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T23:13:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T08:29:27.979804+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T23:37:54.476220+00:00","content_hash":"216e223e4822bd3e16b4fc4e899f0d6dd95d2da1f93dd91e1506959999368ac3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}